note as BIZ_diagram_24_pharmacy_core
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A pharmacy is an independent data-owning organization even when physically
  located inside a hospital, office or nursing facility. It can operate through
  direct backend integration or manual data entry without sharing unrestricted
  access to the host organization's data.
end note

