note as ISOLATION_diagram_24_pharmacy_core
  DATA OWNERSHIP
  The pharmacy tenant owns product, price, inventory and dispensing records.
  A host hospital relationship is an affiliation only. Access is granted by
  explicit contracts, purpose-of-use policies and delegated memberships.
end note


